⚡⚡🇾🇪🇸🇦 Ansarallah has captured the strategic Red Sea port city of Mokha, following a rapid offensive that overran Saudi-backed PLC positions along Yemen’s western coast.

Houthi forces entered Mokha’s city center after earlier capturing Camp Khalid, Hays, Al-Khukha and Yakhtal and reaching Mokha International Airport, marking a major collapse of PLC defenses along this section of the Red Sea coast.

@medmannews

—❗️🇸🇦/🇾🇪 BREAKING: Ansarallah have entered the port city of Mokha

The city hasn’t been fully secured yet, operations are still ongoing.

